<title>MEXICO: GBM-Atlantico Q1 97 net 37.03 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>GBM-Atlantico Q1 97 net 37.03 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			  1996</p>
<p>	Net		    37.03 million		86.72 million</p>
<p>	Revs		   74.21 million		98.21 million</p>
<p>	Oper Costs	   73.52 million		96.68 million</p>
<p>	  NOTE: All figures in Mexican pesos.</p>
<p>	  Full company name is Grupo Financiero GBM-Atlantico.</p>
<p>The Q1 1997 results were reported for the first time using U.S. GAAP accounting standards.</p>
<p>((--Henry Tricks, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9560))</p>
